From: Mr_Kang_Yi <kangyi9@h-partners.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 08:57:08 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [patch 13] fix: propagate effect handler options to the AST
 lexer

Forward enableEH alongside enableLocalMode in SetLexerOptions so macro lexing and error reparsing preserve effect-handler keywords.

Validation: incremental standard library build and SDK installation; 27/27 LLT cases pass, including test_cangjieLex_eh.cj and the disabled-EH negative case.
Signed-off-by: Mr_Kang_Yi <kangyi9@h-partners.com>
---
 stdlib/libs/std/ast/native/ast_api.cpp | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/stdlib/libs/std/ast/native/ast_api.cpp b/stdlib/libs/std/ast/native/ast_api.cpp
index 2b6a2e10192fb03b5e4f7d249f0c44edfc39c9d0..c6204f980a89f6b4cdab1b51514cb5ad440d5f53 100644
--- a/stdlib/libs/std/ast/native/ast_api.cpp
+++ b/stdlib/libs/std/ast/native/ast_api.cpp
@@ -55,6 +55,7 @@ const GlobalOptions* GetGlobalOptions(void* fptr)
 void SetLexerOptions(Lexer& lex, const GlobalOptions* opts)
 {
     lex.SetLocalModeEnabled(!opts || opts->enableLocalMode);
+    lex.SetEHEnabled(opts && opts->enableEH);
 }
 
 std::string ParseWithError(
